cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "QuantumVerif-Bench: Formal Verification of Quantum Programs in Python with ESBMC"
abstract: >
  QuantumVerif-Bench is a PIBITI (UFAM) undergraduate research project on formal
  verification of quantum programs written in Python, using ESBMC (Efficient
  SMT-Based Model Checker) to check state normalization, unitary consistency, and
  measurement validity across a suite of quantum computing benchmarks.
